      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "intro",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "text": "This is Working Draft's audio overview of the Impeachment Trial of Vice President Sara Duterte for July 13, 2026. This is a working reference, not an official Senate record or a finding on the merits.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The principal witness",
      "text": "The session centered on Jeremy C. Lotoc, the NBI regional director for BARMM and a former chief of its Cybercrime Division. He was the sitting's only sworn witness and described the division's investigation of recorded statements attributed to Vice President Sara Duterte.",
