    {
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Senator-judge question",
      "text": "Bam Aquino asked the defense to identify where its answer specifically denied the allegation. Defense counsel cited paragraphs 3 and 197, denied that Duterte had actually spoken to a hitman, and reserved its right to present evidence later.",
