    {
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Senator-judge motion",
      "text": "Juan Miguel Zubiri moved to stop for the evening. Defense counsel said cross-examination was only about halfway complete, and the court carried the unfinished examination to the next sitting.",
