    {
      "id": "P011",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The allegation of bias",
      "text": "The defense suggested through questioning that the NBI-DOJ relationship and the President's status as an alleged offended party created bias against the Vice President. Lotoc denied presidential intervention and said the investigation was evidence-based. The exchange produced no finding of bias.",
