    {
      "id": "P012",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "What the media interviews covered",
      "text": "The interview records reflected questions focused on one recorded statement, and the session did not establish exactly what video each interviewee was shown. Lotoc maintained that the NBI authenticated the complete recording and that the media interviewees had participated in the full press conference. The defense's context challenge therefore remained unresolved.",
