    {
      "id": "P013",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Unsigned minutes and repeated text",
      "text": "The defense also pointed to interview minutes that lacked the NBI interviewer's signature and to the same apparent typographical error in three agent affidavits. Lotoc acknowledged that the NBI used templates and agreed that one of the affidavits could have followed a template. The exchange did not establish fabrication or determine who copied what.",
