    {
      "id": "P014",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Where the criminal referral stood",
      "text": "The defense emphasized that the NBI recommendation did not bind the Justice Department or the courts. Lotoc agreed that it was a recommendation for DOJ assessment, understood the referral to remain in preliminary investigation, and said the NBI had received no further DOJ update. No DOJ charging resolution or criminal-court adjudication was introduced in this sitting.",
